        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "99bb311f-e697-514b-9048-6e6557073331",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Petit Basset Griffon Vendéen, Toy Trawler Spaniel\n- People: Sara Robertson, Wendy Doherty, Gavin Robertson\n- Places: Vendée, France\n- Events: Crufts 2013\n- Concepts: scent hound, Spaniel, show dog\n\nFacts:\n- The Petit Basset Griffon Vendéen, or PBGV, is a dog breed of the scent hound type.\n- The Petit Basset Griffon Vendéen was bred to trail hares in the bramble-filled terrain of the Vendée district of France.\n- The Toy Trawler Spaniel is an extinct Spaniel breed.\n- The Toy Trawler Spaniel physically resembled the 16th-century King Charles Spaniel.\n- Soletrader Peek A Boo, also known as Jilly, is a Petit Basset Griffon Vendéen show dog.\n- Soletrader Peek A Boo is owned by Sara Robertson and Wendy Doherty and handled by Gavin Robertson.\n- Soletrader Peek A Boo won Best in Show at Crufts in 2013.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
